<translation id="3197730452537982411">Masofaviy ish stoli</translation>
<translation id="6898090158927982244">Linux tizimingiz yangilangan</translation>
<translation id="4886703929102211360">Linux (beta) komponenti uchun muhim yangilanish mavjud. Ushbu yangilanishni imkon qadar tezroq o'rnatish tavsiya etiladi, aks holda Linux (beta) ishlamay qolishi mumkin.</translation>
